{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Mila hears a drum in the park: boom, boom, boom. She feels the beat in her feet.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.44,0.78],[0.85,0.89],[0.96,1.25],[1.32,1.42],[1.46,1.53],[1.6,2.21],[2.59,3.1],[3.17,3.67],[3.73,4.39],[4.71,4.88],[4.96,5.26],[5.31,5.38],[5.45,5.69],[5.75,5.84],[5.92,6.04],[6.12,6.87]]},{"text":"At the music tent, she sees a violin, a flute, and a drum from different places.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.22,0.29],[0.35,0.71],[0.77,1.15],[1.2,1.35],[1.41,1.66],[1.71,1.75],[1.82,2.62],[2.87,2.95],[3.09,3.56],[3.59,3.75],[3.82,3.84],[3.92,4.32],[4.41,4.62],[4.71,5.16],[5.2,6.18]]},{"text":"A musician taps a hand drum with steady rhythm. Everyone claps together.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.2,0.72],[0.79,1.14],[1.18,1.23],[1.31,1.57],[1.59,1.92],[1.99,2.17],[2.23,2.61],[2.68,3.22],[3.6,4.13],[4.2,4.56],[4.61,5.53]]},{"text":"Another player blows a flute with a soft, floating sound.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.5,0.88],[0.96,1.31],[1.37,1.39],[1.47,1.82],[1.87,2.06],[2.1,2.15],[2.22,2.57],[2.61,3.05],[3.13,3.95]]},{"text":"Soon a bigger drum group plays a fast pattern that makes kids want to dance.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.4,0.42],[0.51,0.81],[0.86,1.15],[1.23,1.53],[1.6,1.89],[1.94,1.99],[2.07,2.43],[2.51,2.97],[3.03,3.19],[3.27,3.56],[3.66,3.99],[4.06,4.33],[4.38,4.45],[4.52,5.34]]},{"text":"Mila learns rhythm means a beat that repeats again and again.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.48,0.87],[0.96,1.29],[1.35,1.63],[1.68,1.73],[1.81,2.03],[2.09,2.25],[2.33,2.82],[2.88,3.24],[3.32,3.46],[3.53,4.37]]},{"text":"Some songs are slow and calm. Others are quick and exciting.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.36,0.72],[0.77,0.93],[0.97,1.26],[1.32,1.42],[1.51,2.15],[2.47,2.82],[2.88,3.03],[3.1,3.4],[3.47,3.59],[3.66,4.74]]},{"text":"Families form a circle dance, stepping left and right with smiles.","words":[[0,0.56],[0.64,0.92],[0.97,1],[1.09,1.54],[1.59,2.11],[2.32,2.75],[2.83,3.11],[3.17,3.29],[3.37,3.68],[3.74,3.94],[4.02,5.11]]},{"text":"Mila notices friends who speak different languages can still move to the same beat.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.44,1],[1.14,1.53],[1.58,1.71],[1.78,2.11],[2.19,2.61],[2.68,3.4],[3.79,3.99],[4.08,4.43],[4.53,4.81],[4.85,4.95],[5.02,5.11],[5.18,5.54],[5.62,6.41]]},{"text":"At bedtime she taps a gentle rhythm and remembers: music can connect everyone.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.82],[0.87,0.99],[1.06,1.36],[1.41,1.45],[1.53,1.92],[1.97,2.33],[2.42,2.57],[2.65,3.45],[3.83,4.19],[4.24,4.39],[4.47,4.88],[4.95,5.94]]}]}